   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="uva.00084.001.jpg"/>
   <p>I suppose <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">there can be</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">at this day</add></del><add place="above" seq="4">one can say</add></subst>
   nothing <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><gap extent="a few characters" reason="illegible"></gap></add></del> new <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">offered</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">said</add></del></subst> <add place="above">at this day</add> about
   Oriental Poetry&#8212;but <del rend="overstrike">I</del> will
   <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><gap extent="four words" reason="illegible"></gap></del><add place="above" seq="2">there ever <del rend="overstrike" seq="3">come a <gap extent="one word" reason="illegible"></gap></del></add><add place="above" seq="4">be</add></subst>time
   or place&#8212;<del rend="overstrike">no</del> <add place="above">&#8212;<del rend ="overstrike">any</del><seg xml:id="alt001">every</seg><add place="above" xml:id="alt002">any</add><alt target="#alt001" "#alt002"/></add> student, <del rend="overstrike">ambitious</del>
   to seeking <gap extent="a few characters" reason="illegible"></gap> achievement
   in of p<gap extent="a few characters" reason="illegible"></gap> the grand art
   seeking achievement worth
   mentoring&#8212;without when
   the old Asiatic poetic
   bequests are not indispensable?
   every be student in the
   grand art, to whom thy will
   not be more than all
   else in the garnerage
   of the past?</p>

   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="uva.00084.002.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
